post_install() {
  cat <<'EOF'
The CLI is installed as /usr/bin/whodb.

On x86_64 and aarch64 its first run downloads the BAML library from
GitHub into the user cache, and whodb exits when that fails.

whodb sends anonymous usage analytics to PostHog by default.
WHODB_CLI_ANALYTICS_DISABLED=true or --no-analytics turns them off.
EOF
}
